<title>PHILIPPINES: Unioil says approves capital increase.</title>
<headline>Unioil says approves capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unioil and Gas Development Co Inc said on Friday its board had approved an increase in its authorised capital to five billion pesos from 600 million pesos.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange the capital increase was approved by its board on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
